worldwide (before deducting any taxes, costs, operating expenses, or write-offs),
consolidated with the Annual Gross Revenue of all of Licensee's Affiliates, during
the most recently completed fiscal year or the preceding twelve (12) consecutive months.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Software in connection with any commercial,
business, operational, production, or revenue-generating activity, including but not
limited to hosting, deployment in enterprise infrastructure, running workloads for
internal operations, or offering services to third parties.

"Licensee" (or "You") means the individual or single legal entity exercising rights
under this License.

"Managed Service" means any service where the Software, or a substantial portion of
its functionality (such as model execution, inference, or text generation), is hosted
