(e.g., Inference-as-a-Service, Model-as-a-Service, or hosted API), whether for a
direct fee, as part of a subscription, or bundled with other commercial offerings.

"Revenue Threshold" means ten million United States Dollars ($10,000,000 USD), or
its equivalent in other currencies based on official foreign exchange rates.

